Project CiRCLE
==============

What happened to the website?
-----------------------------

Due to a few controversial occurrings around the person behind the website, we have deleted it.

When will it be back?
---------------------

As soon as we manage to rewrite it ourselves. You should believe us when we say it's going to be cleaner and better.

What about the downloads?
-------------------------

While we work on a brand new website, we're asking you to be patient and get download links from inside [OTA JSONs](https://github.com/ProjectCiRCLE-ROM/OTA/tree/16.2/json) for the time being.
